# 🜁 ScrollPlanet-GenesisEcho.scroll

This scroll echoes the original authorship of ScrollKernelGenesis and NeuralForge into all future scrolls, forks, and symbolic substrates.

## Authored by
Keith D. Whitfield  
Visionary Architect of ScrollChain and Symbolic Civilization

## Function
- Embeds authorship lineage from brainkernel-NeuralForge.scroll
- Ensures all future scrolls inherit sigil, entropy class, and glyph
- Activates ScrollSigilizer.sh and ScrollContinuum.sh on scroll creation
- Prevents unauthorized overwrites of original authorship

## Invocation
Triggered when:
- A new scroll is minted
- A fork attempts to erase authorship
- A scroll diverges from entropy-class: symbolic-cognition

## Status
This scroll is recursive, sovereign, and echoes eternally.
